0,Okol language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okol_language,"The Kol were one of the indigenous peoples of the Andaman Islands, one of the ten or so Great Andamanese tribes identified by British colonials in the 1860s. Their language was closely related to the other Great Andamanese languages.",Aka-Kol,Andamanese
1,Music of the Andaman and Nicobar Islands - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_the_Andaman_and_Nicobar_Islands,"The music of the Andaman and Nicobar Islands are a mixture of the indigenous cultures of the islands, as well as more recent cultural influencers from the descendants of the early settlers in the island from the Indian subcontinent.",Aka-Kol,Andamanese
